UTHTA HAI AB JANAZA LAILA KI HASRATON KA<br>
SAR TA QADAM HAI KHOON MEIN BARSON JISE THA PALA<br>
<br>
Manzar pisar ka aise Allah na dikhaye<br>
Beta tadap raha hai barchi jigar pe khaye<br>
Aansu lahu ke Sheh ko ro ro ke jo rulaye<br>
Sheh kar rahe hai nale bas tham kar kaleja<br>
<br>
Atthara(18) saal maa ne nazon se jis ko pala<br>
Apne pidar ki wo jo ankhon ka tha ujala<br>
Maara tha zalimon ne jis ke jigar pe bhala<br>
Jane khuda ye manzar kis tarha Sheh ne dekha<br>
<br>
Wo aydiyan ragardna kardyal jawan ka paiham<br>
Allah kis tarha se dekhe pidar ye alam<br>
Lashe jawan pe ro kar Sheh kar rahe the matam<br>
Kehte the ankhen kholo do kuch jawab beta<br>
<br>
Akber chale the jis dam madar se hoke rukhsat<br>
Jane lagi thi Sheh ki bas sath hi basarat<br>
Kaise kare gawara apne pisar ki furqat<br>
Murd murd ke mujh ko dekho kehte the Shahe wala<br>
<br>
Milta nahi tha Sheh ko apne pisar ka lasha<br>
Ro ro ke keh rahe the tum kis taraf ho beta<br>
Kuch soojhta nahi hai ankhon mein hai andhera<br>
Apni sada sunao dil phat raha hai mera<br>
<br>
Lasha kabhi uthate rakhte kabhi zamee&rsquo;n par<br>
Kehte the uth na paye ab lash teri dilbar<br>
Maa muntazar hai beta khaime ke dar pe muztar<br>
Is haal mein jo dekhe marjayegi wo dukhya<br>
<br>
Ye karb ke manazer kaise Sohail likkhe<br>
Wo khak-o-khoon ka manzar kis tarha maa bhulaye<br>
Saaye me Umme Laila baithi kabhi na haye<br>
Tha maa ke lab pe har dam aye mere laal aaja
